  "solution": {
    "text": "(i) Molten mixture of alumina and cryolite<br /><br />(ii) <math><mn>2</mn><mtext>PbS</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>Pb</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (self-reduction)<br /><br /><math><mtext>PbS</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>PbO</mtext><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>Pb</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (Self reduction)<br /><br /><math><mtext>PbO</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> (carbon reduction)<br /><br />(iii) <math><mtext>Sn</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> (carbon reduction<br /><br />(iv) siderite <math><mo>=</mo><mtext>FeC</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> , cassiterite <math><mo>=</mo><mtext>Sn</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and argentite <math><mo>=</mo><mtext>A</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
